r</span>: Remember, I bought that cheesecake for dessert. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Sal,  <span class=\"italic\">Boston Nights</span> is on later tonight. The last episode was such a cliffhanger ... I can't wait! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, Jake, the police officer is still in the hospital.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You two love that show! How about I join you?", "time": "39500", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}